# =============================================================================
#  PGM-AUA.orch - A-User opens the door (MPAI-PGM V1.0, the A-User App of M3313)
#  Workflow Description Language v0.3, AIF V3.0
#
#  One Controller, one Module, which runs continuously: the A-User Module (PGM-ATU) of the Host User
#  waits in a room of an M-Instance with one door. The User Agent of the Host User binds its devices to
#  the boundary of the Module for the life of the workflow:
#    Command         - the Human Command: "When someone rings, open the door and say hello", typed or
#                      spoken (recognised by the Module's own AIMs from the speech)
#    Hearing         - what the Host User hears in the room: speech, sounds (the bell, a knock)
#    Seeing          - what the Host User sees in the room: the Visual Object
#    Room            - the answers of the M-Instance to the Process Actions of the Module
#    Response        - the Human Command Response (Accepted, Rejected, Refused ...), shown to the person
#    Doing           - the Actions of the Module in the room (walk to the door, open it) and its Process
#                      Action Requests to the M-Instance
#    Avatar          - the A-User's Portable Avatar: its speech, its face and its body, played on the
#                      avatar of the Host User
#  It names no AIM.
# =============================================================================

workflow PGM-AUA over 1PGM-ATU-V1.0-I01

on Start:

    ask Controller to start

    stream  Command         (PGM-HCM-V1.0)  from device "Command"
    stream  Speech          (OSD-BSO-V1.5)  from device "Hearing"
    stream  Text            (OSD-BTO-V1.5)  from device "Hearing"
    stream  Sound           (OSD-BAO-V1.5)  from device "Hearing"
    stream  Sight           (OSD-BVO-V1.5)  from device "Seeing"
    stream  RoomAnswer      (MMM-PAC-V2.2)  from device "Room"

    deliver Response        (PGM-HCM-V1.0)  to device "Response"
    deliver Action          (MMM-ACT-V2.2)  to device "Doing"
    deliver RoomRequest     (MMM-PAC-V2.2)  to device "Room"
    deliver Avatar          (PAF-PAV-V1.6)  to device "Avatar"

    prompt "The A-User is ready. Tell it what to do when the bell rings, then let the Visitor ring."

    loop until Stop:
        wait 1s

on Stop:

    ask Controller to stop
